WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.550
¿Cómo dices: tengo muchas ganas de verte?

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.050
See you on Saturday!

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.750
I'm looking forward to seeing you.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.950
Después de look forward to, usa un verbo en -ing.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.500
Como seeing.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.900
O un sustantivo: I'm looking forward to the weekend.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.800
Ahora tú: I'm looking forward to…

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.700
¿Cómo la completas?
